<p class="legal__lede">ONYX provides custom design and development services, so refunds depend on how much work has been done. This policy sets out exactly what happens if a project is cancelled.</p>

<h2>1. Cancelling before work starts</h2>
<p>If you cancel within <b><%= biz.terms.coolingOffDays %> days</b> of paying the advance <b>and</b> before we have started work, we refund the advance in full.</p>

<h2>2. Cancelling after work has started</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The advance (<%= biz.terms.depositPercent %>% of the project fee) covers work already scheduled and carried out, and is not refundable once work has begun.</li>
  <li>If the work completed so far is worth more than you have paid, we invoice the difference based on the milestones reached.</li>
  <li>Once that is paid, we hand over everything completed up to the cancellation date.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Completed milestones</h2>
<p>Payments for milestones that have been delivered and approved by you are not refundable.</p>

<h2>4. If we cancel</h2>
<p>If we have to end a project for reasons other than a breach by you, we refund everything you have paid for work not yet delivered.</p>

<h2>5. Third-party costs</h2>
<p>Domains, hosting, paid fonts, plugins and other third-party purchases made for your project cannot be refunded by us once bought, because they are paid to other companies. They remain yours.</p>

<h2>6. Care plans and subscriptions</h2>
<p>Monthly care plans can be cancelled at any time with effect from the next billing period. Months already started are not refunded.</p>

<h2>7. How to request a refund</h2>
<p>Email <a class="link" href="mailto:<%= biz.email %>"><%= biz.email %></a> with your name and invoice number. We will reply within 7 business days. Approved refunds are paid to the original payment method within 14 business days.</p>

<h2>8. Disputes</h2>
<p>If you disagree with a decision, please talk to us first; most issues can be solved quickly. Our <a class="link" href="/terms">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> set out the law and courts that apply.</p>
